<title>UK: Barclays sets 300 mln stg step-up FRN.</title>
<headline>Barclays sets 300 mln stg step-up FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following subordinated floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager BZW.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BARCLAYS PLC</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN STG   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY  **12.MAR.12</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN   **+20 BP    PAY DATE    12.MAR.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AA3	 ISS PRICE  99.65     FULL FEES   35 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   AA-	 REOFFER    99.65</p>
<p> NOTES   ** CALL FROM 12.MAR.07, AFTER WHICH MARGIN IS +120 BP</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  BRITAIN   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    15 BP     SELL CONC  20 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
